9,Levuka,https://fijitraveller.com/culture/levuka/,"September 16, 2025 - While a Heritage Bill to provide for the domestic application of the World Heritage Convention is still to make its way through parliament—with calls from townspeople for more consultation—UNESCO recognises Levuka as: “A rare example of a late colonial port town that was influenced in its development by the indigenous community which continued to outnumber the European settlers.",Levuka,Austronesian
